╭ System upgrade ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│⚠ System upgrades can't be undone by kast.                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                          │
│/ is btrfs with snapper: kast can take a snapshot before the upgrade (and one after), to roll back to.                                    │
│                                                                                                                                          │
│limine-snapper-sync lists the snapshots in the boot menu: boot one to go back.                                                            │
